WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.510
What is <i>wrong</i> with you?

00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:05.420
Don't mind me.

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:07.580
I'm just hanging around.

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:09.340
Just do as you'd normally do.

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:11.350
You know, interviews,
going to the bathroom,

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:13.880
taking a bath, and changing clothes.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:16.700
What kind of photos are
you planning to take?

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.570
And I don't take baths at school!

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:21.730
You do at home, right?

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:22.920
You pervert!

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:24.660
Are you going to follow me home?

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:28.550
Anyway, stop following me around!

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:31.300
I'd love to, but this is my job.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:33.280
A job?

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:37.440
What kind of job involves
invading a girl's privacy?

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:41.120
I'm really amazed you had
the guts to say that.

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:45.450
Anyway, I'm going to be following
you around everywhere today.

00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:47.180
You're a stalker!

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:51.190
You just said you're a stalker!

00:02:22.690 --> 00:02:24.610
We need to focus on
the side characters!

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:25.550
Huh?

00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:28.850
With the arrival of a
new character, Ringo-chan,

00:02:28.850 --> 00:02:31.150
I'm sure all of the side
characters are worried they're

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:32.980
going to lose screen time.

00:02:34.540 --> 00:02:37.210
As someone who's character
overlaps with Ringo-chan's,

00:02:37.210 --> 00:02:39.140
that's a serious concern for me.

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:42.590
I think it's a good idea.

00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:46.500
I've see lots of side
character spin-offs, lately.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:47.480
Yeah, that's it!

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:48.370
A spin-off!

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:50.740
A spin-off of Student
Council's Discretion!

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:52.640
Who'd be in it?

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:57.860
Hmm... Somebody who's in the anime,
but not really getting a lot of focus.

00:02:59.270 --> 00:03:02.470
And so, you were chosen.

00:03:02.810 --> 00:03:04.020
Congratulations.

00:03:04.020 --> 00:03:07.770
I'd be thrilled if they hadn't sent you!

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:10.390
You don't need to focus on me at all.

00:03:10.570 --> 00:03:14.540
Anyway, I have to get
some editing work done.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:20.200
By the way, Lilicia-san,
where's the other staff?

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:21.170
They're not here.

00:03:21.650 --> 00:03:24.690
It's my job to edit all the
articles and finish the paper.

00:03:24.690 --> 00:03:27.230
It's faster to work alone.

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:28.040
I see.

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:29.540
Nobody wants to work with you.

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:31.320
W-Wrong!

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:33.320
I don't work alone.

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:35.680
I have a lot of staff.

00:03:35.930 --> 00:03:36.880
I see.

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:38.420
They just don't like you.

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:41.430
Who do you think I am?

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:42.940
A sub-heroine?

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:45.720
I regret asking!

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:48.940
Well, given the amount of
screen time you get,

00:03:48.940 --> 00:03:50.640
it's hard to call you a main heroine.

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:55.540
I can get behind the idea of
casting a blonde, rich girl.

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:58.050
But your intense personality
is a bit of a problem.

00:03:58.360 --> 00:04:00.480
What are you talking about?

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:05.710
There's nothing even remotely
problematic about my personality.

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:11.720
That's what makes you a side character.

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:16.730
Y-You don't have to keep
calling me that, do you?

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:19.720
I'm a girl, too.

00:04:19.720 --> 00:04:23.500
I want a prince who will love only me.

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:25.310
What's wrong?

00:04:25.310 --> 00:04:27.000
Are you talking to God?

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:30.560
That's a very large-scale
misunderstanding!

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:32.770
I'm keeping you from working.

00:04:33.320 --> 00:04:34.490
I'll wait till you're done...

00:04:34.490 --> 00:04:36.130
Su-Sugisaki Ken!

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:38.520
Um...

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:45.140
If I wanted to stop being a
side character, what should I do?

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:53.800
It's great to have Sugisaki gone.

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:56.570
It's a lot quieter, certainly.

00:04:56.570 --> 00:04:58.550
I think the other students
should experience

00:04:58.550 --> 00:05:00.940
how annoying he is, once in a while!

00:05:01.090 --> 00:05:05.960
Yeah, and I love how we're
making Lilicia deal with him!

00:05:07.670 --> 00:05:10.180
Aka-chan is so cute when she's evil.

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:13.860
There's no work today, either.

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:15.450
Oh, right.

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:17.330
Mafuyu-chan.

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:18.550
Yes?

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:21.110
Can I borrow you for
a bit when we're done?

00:05:21.110 --> 00:05:24.090
Sure, but just Mafuyu?

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:24.830
Yeah.

00:05:29.170 --> 00:05:30.100
Who's that?

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:32.330
E-Excuse me.

00:05:33.280 --> 00:05:35.340
I mean, I'm coming in!

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:37.840
Li-Lilicia?

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:40.420
Wh-What happened to your hair?

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:41.300
Sakurano Kurimu!

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:41.810
Yes?

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:43.350
This is for you.

00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:46.060
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:48.870
D-Don't get the wrong idea!

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:52.090
I just had some left after home ec...

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:56.220
I didn't get up early to make
this for you, or anything.

00:05:57.280 --> 00:05:58.750
U-Um...

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:01.550
Look. Look. Look. Look!

00:06:01.550 --> 00:06:03.600
She's showing off how hard she tried!

00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:06.180
Th-Thanks, I guess...

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:08.000
D-Don't get the wrong idea!

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:11.300
I definitely don't like you.

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:13.130
I don't have the wrong idea.

00:06:13.130 --> 00:06:14.660
I just wanted to thank you!

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:16.480
D-Don't get the wrong idea!

00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:18.580
Those aren't cookies, okay?

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:19.310
They're not?

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:20.620
You said they were, right?

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:22.650
D-Don't get the wrong idea!

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:25.620
It's just something I bought
at the school store.

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:27.740
You're right.

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:29.880
Well, that's still pretty nice of you.

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:30.720
Thanks.

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:32.130
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:32.740
Total: 315 yen

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:35.030
You're gonna pay me back, right?
Total: 315 yen

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:36.040
I have to pay?

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:37.660
Then I don't want them!

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:39.730
D-Don't get the wrong idea.

00:06:39.730 --> 00:06:42.270
It doesn't matter what you want, okay?

00:06:42.270 --> 00:06:44.390
This is really mean!

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:45.770
What's wrong with you, Lilicia?

00:06:45.770 --> 00:06:48.600
Did sending Sugisaki
over make you that mad?

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:50.960
D-Don't get the wrong idea!

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:53.420
I really am mad about that!

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:55.290
I don't have the wrong idea at all!

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:57.220
I was right!

00:06:58.510 --> 00:07:00.960
You yell too much.

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:02.730
She went back to normal.

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:08.460
Okay, good so far.

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:09.970
Lilicia?

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:12.470
Wait a minute.

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:14.660
I'll check the next part.

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:16.970
The next part?

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:22.030
Sakurano, is there anybody you like?

00:07:22.030 --> 00:07:23.850
Why are we suddenly
talking about love?

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:25.320
I don't!

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:27.120
And I don't want to talk about it—

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:29.120
I see! You don't!

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:31.390
I see!

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:37.860
Jeez... Nobody would want
to date you, anyway.

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:39.460
What's that?

00:07:39.460 --> 00:07:42.000
Why am I being attacked?

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:44.440
Oh, fine. Sakurano.

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:45.980
That's right, poor Sakurano.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.320
Poor, poor Sakurano.

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:49.690
I could go out with you if you wanted!

00:07:50.420 --> 00:07:52.770
Our student council
already has enough yuri!

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:57.010
Um, President, was that really
the right answer to give?

00:07:57.010 --> 00:07:58.720
Stare...

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:00.910
What?

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:01.950
Nothing!

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:06.960
Just kidding!

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:10.290
I'd never go out with you, silly!

00:08:11.710 --> 00:08:13.710
Okay, I'm leaving!

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:21.770
I tripped!

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:24.620
I trip over nothing, you know!

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:30.270
You pervert!

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:39.220
Perfect!

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:40.150
I'm so great!

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:42.160
Everything I do is perfect!

00:08:43.360 --> 00:08:45.920
I did it, Sugisaki Ken!

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:47.000
How did it go?

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:49.600
Am I a main heroine now?

00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:52.270
Lilicia-san, you were
very, very creepy!

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:57.120
You're the one who put a microphone
on me and told me to do that!

00:08:57.970 --> 00:08:59.100
You broke it.

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:01.890
Forget that! How was I creepy?

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:03.950
I was really surprised!

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:07.950
I didn't know it was possible to
be a tsundere, a childhood friend,

00:09:07.950 --> 00:09:10.250
and clumsy, and <i>still</i>
be as creepy as you!

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:11.720
You're saying it's my fault?

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:15.890
Visually, you look okay.

00:09:15.890 --> 00:09:18.090
I wonder what the problem was.

00:09:18.090 --> 00:09:23.100
The fact that I met you.

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:25.970
Nah. You don't have to
be a tsundere anymore.

00:09:25.970 --> 00:09:28.060
I was speaking from the heart!

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:30.590
Fine.

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:33.800
There was something in it
for the newspaper club.

00:09:35.270 --> 00:09:37.500
Can I borrow you for
a bit when we're done?

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:40.480
Sure, but just Mafuyu?

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:43.350
I smell a scoop!

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:47.260
Sugisaki Ken, I've got
some reporting to do...

00:09:47.260 --> 00:09:48.050
Okay!

00:09:48.050 --> 00:09:49.750
I'll follow you anywhere!

00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:53.760
Get lost!

00:09:59.690 --> 00:10:02.740
What was wrong with
Lilicia back there?

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:05.120
She wasted a lot of time.

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:08.380
Um, I'm sorry to bother
you when you're angry,

00:10:08.380 --> 00:10:11.750
but can you tell me where we're going?

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.470
A battlefield.

00:10:13.470 --> 00:10:14.150
Huh?

00:10:19.120 --> 00:10:21.420
Now, there's no time to waste!

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:23.390
We have to buy clothes.

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:24.650
Clothes?

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:25.670
Let's go!

00:10:25.670 --> 00:10:27.520
It's time for war, men!

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:34.410
Um, if this were a crowded sale,
I could understand, but...

00:10:34.410 --> 00:10:36.390
President!

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:38.180
Now let's go.

00:10:38.690 --> 00:10:39.800
I see.

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:41.390
So you're planning to watch
the President and Mafuyu

00:10:41.390 --> 00:10:43.840
in order to steal some
tips on being a heroine.

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:46.450
You must be pretty
desperate, Lilicia-san.

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:48.260
No!

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:50.590
How long are you going
to drag that gag out?

00:10:50.900 --> 00:10:53.240
Just you wait, Sakurano Kurimu!

00:10:53.240 --> 00:10:58.700
I'll pay you back double
for subjecting me to this stalker!

00:11:02.190 --> 00:11:05.910
President, you should try to
enjoy shopping a little more.

00:11:06.670 --> 00:11:10.870
And that attitude's why
you're still not a main character.

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:14.020
I-I'm shocked!

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:16.690
Mafuyu's not a main character?

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:19.190
You give Minatsu someone to play off of.

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:21.730
She's main and I'm not?

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:23.770
Wait!

00:11:23.770 --> 00:11:25.990
Is this part of the focus
on side characters, too?

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:28.490
Is that why you only invited me?

00:11:29.390 --> 00:11:31.650
Well, something like that.

00:11:31.650 --> 00:11:34.410
If you hang out with me, the heroine,

00:11:34.410 --> 00:11:37.410
you'll get to be on the side
of the screen all the time.

00:11:37.410 --> 00:11:40.000
Mafuyu's face doesn't even
get to be on screen anymore!

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:41.220
There, there...

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:45.770
For today, just watch me and learn what
it means to be the main character.

00:11:45.770 --> 00:11:47.830
You're the main character!

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:50.840
You're totally wrong, Sakurano Kurimu.

00:11:50.840 --> 00:11:52.880
No, not so much.

00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:57.210
It looks like playtime is over.

00:11:58.140 --> 00:11:59.520
Don't you remember, Mafuyu?

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:01.040
This is a battlefield.

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:06.800
I will now show you the
truth of this world.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:09.890
That line sounds like something
a main character would say,

00:12:09.890 --> 00:12:11.370
but what are you...

00:12:11.970 --> 00:12:15.330
Miss, the kids clothes are
on the floor below.

00:12:18.310 --> 00:12:22.410
Even in these times of peace,
she lives a life of battle.

00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:23.520
That's a main character.

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:27.000
That's what you get, Sakurano Kurimu!

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:29.520
Time for my scoop!

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:33.490
Mafuyu can't see!

00:12:33.900 --> 00:12:35.800
Are you okay, Lilicia-san?

00:12:35.800 --> 00:12:37.800
Th-Thank you.

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:39.010
Not at all.

00:12:39.010 --> 00:12:41.500
Anyway, you're still
doing the clumsy thing?

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:42.360
Huh?

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:44.810
And polite and kind on top of it?

00:12:44.810 --> 00:12:47.630
You must really want
to be more popular.

00:12:54.380 --> 00:12:55.540
President...

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:59.310
Mafuyu-chan, this is the
truth of this world.

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:01.530
Mafuyu was wrong!

00:13:01.530 --> 00:13:04.820
For you, shopping really is a war!

00:13:05.830 --> 00:13:09.060
If you understand, then let's go
to the next store, Mafuyu-chan.

00:13:09.060 --> 00:13:12.380
But what's wrong with the clothes here?

00:13:12.380 --> 00:13:16.920
It looks like the clerks
aren't likely to bother you.

00:13:17.370 --> 00:13:18.440
My, my...

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:22.440
That's why you'll always
be Mafuyu-chan.

00:13:23.430 --> 00:13:26.490
Why am I being
treated so horribly

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:28.930
after I agreed to go shopping?

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:32.460
Then I'll show you the truth
of the world once more!

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:35.590
Excuse me, I'd like to
try some clothes on.

00:13:35.590 --> 00:13:38.260
Once more?

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:42.100
Watch carefully.

00:13:42.100 --> 00:13:45.810
I don't really understand, but okay.

00:13:45.810 --> 00:13:47.080
Just wait.

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:52.260
What do you think is gonna happen?

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:53.740
Be quiet, she's coming out.

00:13:57.090 --> 00:13:58.410
Legs! Bare legs!

00:13:58.670 --> 00:14:00.580
What are you doing?

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:04.050
P-President...

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:07.730
You're an S size and it's still huge...

00:14:07.730 --> 00:14:08.440
You can't mean...

00:14:08.440 --> 00:14:09.300
Yes.

00:14:09.300 --> 00:14:13.290
This is the cruel truth of the world.

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:14.470
That's horrible!

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:17.960
Even the last fortress of the
petite, the S size,

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:19.020
has rejected you?

00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:21.500
That's just awful!

00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:22.760
Miss...

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:23.970
Yes?

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:28.290
If that's too large, we have
some XS clothes over here.

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:29.260
That's right!

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:30.990
If you're an XS, President...

00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:32.070
I refuse!

00:14:32.310 --> 00:14:33.230
Huh?

00:14:33.230 --> 00:14:34.440
Why?

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:39.950
My pride won't allow me to wear
kids' or XS-sized clothes!

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:41.420
That's gotta be annoying.

00:14:41.420 --> 00:14:45.450
Sakurano Kurimu, you're just wonderful!

00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:48.190
You're just so funny!

00:14:48.790 --> 00:14:51.330
Then there's no way for
you to buy any clothes.

00:14:52.730 --> 00:14:54.420
Real S size.

00:14:55.530 --> 00:14:56.990
Real S size.

00:14:57.440 --> 00:14:59.100
Just as the name suggests,

00:14:59.100 --> 00:15:04.610
find it and the world
is at your fingertips!

00:15:04.850 --> 00:15:08.450
The name does not suggest that at all!

00:15:09.750 --> 00:15:11.130
Perhaps I overstated it.

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:12.610
Real S size.

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:17.150
An S size that is smaller
than the S size of other stores!

00:15:17.150 --> 00:15:19.640
I think you overstated it a lot!

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:23.160
And you're using a backdrop of
the entire Earth to explain it!

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:27.860
So anyway, different stores
have different S sizes.

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:32.120
And so if we look
long and hard enough,

00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:35.870
we can find an outfit that
fits me in an S, not an XS!

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:38.710
So that's a real S size.

00:15:39.070 --> 00:15:41.140
But how do we find it?

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:44.650
It's going to get old fast if you
have to shop at every store.

00:15:44.650 --> 00:15:47.920
Don't worry.
There's a place I always go.

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:51.150
Then why did we come here first?

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:55.260
What's the underclassman upset about?

00:15:55.260 --> 00:15:57.660
It's scary how young people
snap so easily these days.

00:15:57.660 --> 00:16:00.180
My night would've been 20,000 times better

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:01.690
if I'd just played games at home!

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:03.600
I'm mad!

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:06.810
I'm going to finish my shopping alone.

00:16:06.810 --> 00:16:08.400
Just wait a second.

00:16:08.720 --> 00:16:10.530
Think about it.

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:13.460
What will happen if you leave me here?

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:15.680
What will happen?

00:16:16.400 --> 00:16:20.740
You'll get called over the
mall's loudspeaker system.

00:16:21.420 --> 00:16:21.670
Lost Children's Center

00:16:21.670 --> 00:16:23.320
Shiina Mafuyu-sama, please come
to the lost children's center.

00:16:23.320 --> 00:16:24.850
President!

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:28.240
That's not what the lost
children's center is for!

00:16:28.240 --> 00:16:31.980
Will you still leave me here?

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:36.350
You're right, I wouldn't want that.

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:37.980
I'll go with you...

00:16:37.980 --> 00:16:39.700
No way!

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:41.460
You XS President!

00:16:41.460 --> 00:16:43.440
Don't mess with the Treasurer!

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:45.440
A rift in the student council!

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:47.610
The Treasurer and President face off!

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:49.380
I can't stop writing!

00:16:49.380 --> 00:16:52.360
Lilicia-san, aren't you acting a little

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:55.270
too much like the villain
who tails the hero?

00:16:55.940 --> 00:16:58.000
I am not!

00:16:58.000 --> 00:16:58.950
Let's go!

00:16:59.690 --> 00:17:01.720
Don't pull me!

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:03.310
We've gotta hide!

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:07.260
The place next door is where I go.

00:17:07.260 --> 00:17:12.100
Fine, I'll finish shopping
with you, so let me go.

00:17:12.100 --> 00:17:14.240
Look, Mafuyu-chan!

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:16.360
It's got a cute sea cucumber on it!

00:17:16.360 --> 00:17:18.230
It's very cute.

00:17:18.230 --> 00:17:20.940
So you can buy this one.

00:17:20.940 --> 00:17:22.980
I'm sorry I said anything!

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:26.580
Lilicia-san, you're a lot
more forward than I thought.

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:27.930
Shut up!

00:17:27.930 --> 00:17:30.060
If you try anything, I'll scream.

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:31.990
Even though they're right there?

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:33.560
Oh no!

00:17:33.560 --> 00:17:35.990
I forgot I was with a pervert!

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:37.770
Which do you like?

00:17:37.770 --> 00:17:39.360
Choose one, Mafuyu-chan.

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:41.460
For some reason, she's mad at me.

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:43.040
It's not fair!

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:47.000
Why do I have to choose
a T-shirt for you?

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:50.770
Because we're going
to get matching ones.

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:53.780
So choose one.

00:17:57.920 --> 00:18:00.380
Maybe this bear?

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:03.490
Because Mafuyu is transferring?

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:06.260
That's why, right?

00:18:06.970 --> 00:18:10.770
Mafuyu barely ever
leaves the house...

00:18:11.430 --> 00:18:17.030
Come to think of it, I've never
gone shopping with you!

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:21.220
So you wanted something
to remember me by...

00:18:21.220 --> 00:18:22.790
Hey, hey, Mafuyu-chan.

00:18:23.470 --> 00:18:25.890
What about this kitty T-shirt?

00:18:25.890 --> 00:18:27.500
I like it!

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:32.160
Pink is a good color for both of us!

00:18:32.160 --> 00:18:32.880
Okay!

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:35.010
I'll go get them.

00:18:35.540 --> 00:18:38.820
No, I can buy my own.

00:18:38.820 --> 00:18:40.520
No, it's okay.

00:18:40.520 --> 00:18:41.840
Um...

00:18:41.840 --> 00:18:42.420
I know!

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:44.930
You'll owe me one.

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:47.130
When we meet again,
you can pay me back.

00:18:48.570 --> 00:18:49.830
President...

00:18:51.030 --> 00:18:52.960
Thank you!

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:57.600
I give up.

00:18:58.980 --> 00:19:00.820
N-Nothing.

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:03.110
That Sakurano Kurimu!

00:19:03.110 --> 00:19:05.670
This isn't how I thought
this would end.

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:09.150
So what about your article?

00:19:09.150 --> 00:19:12.240
Of course, it'll be about a rift between

00:19:12.240 --> 00:19:14.220
the President and the Treasurer.

00:19:14.220 --> 00:19:14.520
Wrap them separately.

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:16.270
The newspaper is entertainment,

00:19:16.270 --> 00:19:17.000
All right, just a moment.

00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:20.330
so we can write whatever stories we want!

00:19:22.490 --> 00:19:24.530
I thought I heard Lilicia...

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:28.510
Oh, it's just an owl.

00:19:29.740 --> 00:19:32.980
Lilicia-san, wouldn't it be a pleasant
change to write a nice article?

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:35.360
A nice article?

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:39.140
Sure. Readers might want
a human interests story.

00:19:39.140 --> 00:19:42.610
But then that promise will no longer
belong to just the two of them.

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:45.410
You know?

00:19:48.530 --> 00:19:49.680
What's wrong?

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:51.130
You aren't saying anything.

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:55.610
It's just, if I opened my mouth,
I would've seriously said I like you.

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:58.020
Are you teasing me?

00:19:58.020 --> 00:20:00.270
After all those times you
called me a side character!

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:02.640
Those were just jokes.

00:20:04.270 --> 00:20:10.980
A girl like you, who stays so true to
herself, can't be a side character.

00:20:11.490 --> 00:20:13.390
Wh-What's this, all of a sudden?

00:20:13.390 --> 00:20:15.340
You're complimenting me and being
mean at the same time...

00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:17.920
You're not fair, Sugisaki Ken.

00:20:18.350 --> 00:20:19.390
Come to think of it...

00:20:20.180 --> 00:20:23.930
Have you decided what you'll
do once you graduate?

00:20:26.480 --> 00:20:27.390
Lilicia-san?

00:20:28.970 --> 00:20:30.220
I'm going to get married.

00:20:32.720 --> 00:20:34.280
I thought I heard Sugisaki...

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:35.990
I guess I imagined it.

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:37.440
Probably.

00:20:37.440 --> 00:20:40.940
Keep quiet, will you?

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:49.590
Marriage will expand the
fortunes of the Toudou family.

00:20:49.590 --> 00:20:51.860
And I've already agreed to it.

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:54.690
I can't imagine why you'd
bother getting upset.

00:20:55.860 --> 00:20:57.430
Anyway, we're here.

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:03.850
Be careful on your way back.

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:08.290
Lilicia-san!

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:10.900
What?

00:21:10.900 --> 00:21:14.530
It's your choice to marry
for the sake of your family.

00:21:14.530 --> 00:21:16.980
And I've no right to
say anything about it.

00:21:17.310 --> 00:21:18.280
But...

00:21:18.280 --> 00:21:20.880
If marriage seems like it's
going to make you sad...

00:21:21.590 --> 00:21:24.220
I'll come and ruin it for you!

00:21:25.460 --> 00:21:26.350
That's all!

00:21:26.350 --> 00:21:29.890
This has been Sugisaki Ken,
vice president of the student council!

00:21:32.130 --> 00:21:33.230
Just kidding.

00:21:34.320 --> 00:21:36.490
Anyway, see you tomorrow, Lilicia-san.

00:21:36.490 --> 00:21:39.920
We can take that bath
together some other time.

00:21:39.920 --> 00:21:42.320
W-Wait!

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:44.280
Jeez, what's his problem?

00:21:45.330 --> 00:21:47.920
I guess he got the best of you.

00:21:47.920 --> 00:21:51.110
Wh-What are you doing here, Eris?

00:21:51.390 --> 00:21:54.570
I thought I smelled brother,
so I came running.

00:21:54.570 --> 00:21:55.890
Sniff sniff.

00:21:55.890 --> 00:21:58.390
I can smell him on you!

00:21:58.560 --> 00:22:00.620
What kind of super sense is that?

00:22:01.150 --> 00:22:04.320
Why did you lie like that?

00:22:05.370 --> 00:22:09.010
You turned down that marriage
offer as soon as it came up.

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:10.720
W-Well...

00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:13.590
All I left out was that I refused.

00:22:13.590 --> 00:22:15.900
I didn't lie.

00:22:15.900 --> 00:22:18.910
Look me in the eyes when you speak.

00:22:20.260 --> 00:22:24.220
I-I just wanted to mess
with him a little.

00:22:24.220 --> 00:22:26.150
I didn't think he'd
react like that.

00:22:26.250 --> 00:22:28.650
He never does what you think he will!

00:22:29.550 --> 00:22:32.140
Yeah. It was a good lesson.

00:22:34.270 --> 00:22:36.870
Anyway, let's go inside, Eris.

00:22:36.870 --> 00:22:37.950
Okay!

00:24:09.590 --> 00:24:10.320
Student Council

00:24:10.320 --> 00:24:11.870
What <i>is </i>this?
Student Council

00:24:11.870 --> 00:24:11.900
What <i>is </i>this?

00:24:11.900 --> 00:24:11.920
Excited at the sight of bare legs
What <i>is </i>this?

00:24:11.920 --> 00:24:12.490
Excited at the sight of bare legs

00:24:12.490 --> 00:24:15.690
"Perverted Vice President
Stalks the Loli President?

00:24:16.110 --> 00:24:18.250
Um, well... It's a misunderstanding.

00:24:18.250 --> 00:24:19.320
Yeah.

00:24:20.060 --> 00:24:24.160
You're a horrible person, Lilicia-san!

00:24:25.860 --> 00:24:28.230
How is an open air bath like a chain letter?

00:24:28.230 --> 00:24:28.930
Tell me!

00:24:28.930 --> 00:24:29.970
You can't help but look!

00:24:29.970 --> 00:24:32.360
I'll get rid of everyone who stands in my way.

00:24:32.360 --> 00:24:34.250
It's time for the final boss, my childhood friend!

00:24:34.250 --> 00:24:36.180
Next time: The Student Council Chases

00:24:36.180 --> 00:24:38.310
See you soon!
